#. Approved WordPress.org community translation preserved.
#: admin/class-wc-smart-cod-admin.php:636
msgid "Select \"at least one\", if you want the COD to be restricted when at least one product of the cart is restricted. Select \"all\", if you want the COD to be restricted if all of the cart's product's are restricted. Then add the restricted products in the select field below."
